        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Not used, on purpose:&lt;/b&gt; AgentCore Memory, Knowledge Bases, fine-tuning, a model for phrasing. &lt;b&gt;Status:&lt;/b&gt; every layer runs locally and is tested; every AWS hosting line is written and statically validated, not yet deployed (page 10)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1B2B45;fontStyle=0;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
